// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// Element spec (world mapping per panel: panel-x→+X, panel-z(up)→+Y, panel-y(depth)→+Z):
//  s orbital        → SphereGeometry(0.26) blue #6f9fd8
//  p_x/p_y/p_z      → 2 ellipsoids (SphereGeometry scaled) red #d98a8a + blue #6f9fd8 dumbbell
